; Lab 8.4: Discovery of Designated Resolvers (RFC 9462) for team NN.
; Replace NN with your team number. resolver.teamNN.example must have an A
; (and AAAA) record with the resolver's address in your teamNN.example zone.
$TTL 300
@        IN SOA  resolver.teamNN.example. admin.teamNN.example. 1 3600 600 86400 300
         IN NS   resolver.teamNN.example.
_dns     IN SVCB 1 resolver.teamNN.example. alpn="dot" port=853
_dns     IN SVCB 2 resolver.teamNN.example. alpn="h2" port=443 dohpath="/dns-query{?dns}"
